# Shell scripts run under Git Bash on Windows runners (the release
# workflow), where checkouts otherwise get CRLF line endings.
*.sh text eol=lf

# The vendored SVD files are checked against the SHA-256s in svd/SOURCES:
# keep their bytes as downloaded (no CRLF conversion). GitHub collapses their
# multi-megabyte diffs in pull requests; git still diffs them as text.
svd/*.svd -text linguist-generated
